[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8702.87, "timestamp": "02:25:02", "text": "你刚刚错过了禅宗之子。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8705.27, "timestamp": "02:25:05", "text": "刚刚完成了一次合作。我们玩得很开心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8708.03, "timestamp": "02:25:08", "text": "我们当时在谈论很多……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8716.79, "timestamp": "02:25:16", "text": "谢谢D抽出时间来参加。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8724.79, "timestamp": "02:25:24", "text": "很多。所以达娜，我现在确实意识到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8726.469, "timestamp": "02:25:26", "text": "我刚才说的，我当时在说什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8728.75, "timestamp": "02:25:28", "text": "思考一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8736.309, "timestamp": "02:25:36", "text": "嗯？别担心，我会正式宣布的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8739.349, "timestamp": "02:25:39", "text": "有一天在直播中哭了起来。呃，这周不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8741.349, "timestamp": "02:25:41", "text": "本星期。六月第三周。不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8744.63, "timestamp": "02:25:44", "text": "担心。呃，不过，毕竟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8746.349, "timestamp": "02:25:46", "text": "合作是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8749.349, "timestamp": "02:25:49", "text": "完成了，嗯，我知道这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8752.15, "timestamp": "02:25:52", "text": "上个月的运动马拉松。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8754.95, "timestamp": "02:25:54", "text": "从某种意义上说，Jockathon 就此结束。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8758.23, "timestamp": "02:25:58", "text": "为什么它是白色的，纯白色的，像缩略图一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8759.87, "timestamp": "02:25:59", "text": "如果你"}]